{"name": "Grim Path", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike card crawler where every step is a choice. Descend into dark dungeons, battle monsters, and face various encounters. Choose your gear wisely to survive and go even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On every floor, a choice of events awaits you. Each decision can lead to new challenges, rewards, or unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"392\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/21fdbb8d372d534656b547fb23fb26de.poster.avif?t=1784628126\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/21fdbb8d372d534656b547fb23fb26de.webm?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/21fdbb8d372d534656b547fb23fb26de.mp4?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow stronger through powerful upgrades and events along the way. Every choice shapes your build and determines how far you will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/1811110b749dc3e8b567eed0a693eb09.poster.avif?t=1784628126\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/1811110b749dc3e8b567eed0a693eb09.webm?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/1811110b749dc3e8b567eed0a693eb09.mp4?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character comes with their own set of items and a unique playstyle. Experiment with different heroes, discover new strategies, and adapt your build to survive the depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"406\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/df9e79d286a382f099d099c2538b6c63.poster.avif?t=1784628126\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/df9e79d286a382f099d099c2538b6c63.webm?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/extras/df9e79d286a382f099d099c2538b6c63.mp4?t=1784628126\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A roguelike card crawler where every step is a choice. Descend into dark dungeons, battle monsters, and face various encounters. Choose your gear wisely to survive and go even deeper.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129300/11cbaaa95ca39b37c94e6a10619d6360b012bb78/header.jpg?t=1784628126", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Dungeon Crawler", "Card Game", "Roguelite", "Roguelike", "Strategy", "RPG"], "developers": "Zabbo Games", "publishers": "Zabbo Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4129300", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 May 2026 - Request Access\n\n15 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/KjSm58umUm4", "first_seen": 1779055200.0, "review_rank": 640}